#: ../../api/methods/delete_all_message_reactions.rst:3
msgid "deleteAllMessageReactions"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.methods.delete_all_message_reactions.DeleteAllMessageReactions:1 of
msgid ""
"Use this method to remove up to 10000 recent reactions in a group or a "
"supergroup chat added by a given user or chat. The bot must have the "
"'can_delete_messages' administrator right in the chat. Returns "
":code:`True` on success."
msgstr ""
"Удаляет до 10 000 недавних реакций, оставленных указанным пользователем "
"или чатом в группе или супергруппе. У бота должно быть право "
"администратора :code:`can_delete_messages` в этом чате. При успехе "
"возвращает :code:`True`."

#: litegram.methods.delete_all_message_reactions.DeleteAllMessageReactions:3 of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#deleteallmessagereactions"
msgstr "Источник: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#deleteallmessagereactions"

#: litegram.methods.delete_all_message_reactions.DeleteAllMessageReactions.chat_id:1
#: of
msgid ""
"Unique identifier for the target chat or username of the target "
"supergroup in the format :code:`@username`"
msgstr ""
"Уникальный идентификатор целевого чата или имя целевой супергруппы в "
"формате :code:`@username`"

#: litegram.methods.delete_all_message_reactions.DeleteAllMessageReactions.user_id:1
#: of
msgid ""
"Identifier of the user whose reactions will be removed, if the reactions "
"were added by a user"
msgstr ""
"Идентификатор пользователя, чьи реакции нужно удалить, если они оставлены"
" пользователем"

#: litegram.methods.delete_all_message_reactions.DeleteAllMessageReactions.actor_chat_id:1
#: of
msgid ""
"Identifier of the chat whose reactions will be removed, if the reactions "
"were added by a chat"
msgstr ""
"Идентификатор чата, чьи реакции нужно удалить, если они оставлены от "
"имени чата"

